{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Crush is a Clerk from Hell</strong> is a short, cozy slice-of-life dating sim about late nights, quiet conversations, and a succubus trying to remember what love feels like.<br>You\u2019ll visit the corner shop again and again, getting to know <i>Sam</i>,\u00a0a sharp-tongued, surprisingly honest demon who\u2019s lost her powers and maybe her way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Visual Novel + Card Battler</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083590/extras/d75ab6de0b6ebbcdb5470d5ac0751eaf.poster.avif?t=1772377456\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083590/extras/d75ab6de0b6ebbcdb5470d5ac0751eaf.webm?t=1772377456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting:</strong> A sleepy neighbourhood corner shop that feels a little too alive at night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Role:</strong> You\u2019re an ordinary customer who keeps coming back, not for the milk, but for the mysterious new clerk who swears she\u2019s from Hell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Loop:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the shop and talk with Sam after hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about her world through quiet, funny, and heartfelt conversations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that test honesty, trust, and affection</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance Path:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow closer through banter, small acts of kindness, and late-night visits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your honesty shapes Sam\u2019s fate pure love can set her free, while doubt keeps her trapped</p><